From 81f3925f85fc613fa1f0264545f3ac5aa8152b16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: a52q camera integration <jarda.kotesovec@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:29:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: Add Samsung Galaxy A52 5G tuning files

Soft ISP tuning for the five a52q cameras, derived from the stock CamX
Chromatix tuning (A525FXXUAFXL2): black level, colour correction
matrices, lens shading meshes (Lsc) and, for the main camera, contrast
autofocus over the calibrated AK7374 range.

  s5kgw1p       main (wide)      Lsc, Ccm, Af
  s5k3l6xx      ultra-wide       Lsc, Ccm
  imx616        front            Lsc, Ccm
  gc5035        depth            Lsc, Ccm (macro module matrices)
  gc5035_macro  macro            Lsc, Ccm

The Lsc and Af blocks need the corresponding patches of this series.
---
 src/ipa/simple/data/gc5035.yaml       |  92 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ipa/simple/data/gc5035_macro.yaml |  95 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ipa/simple/data/imx616.yaml       | 118 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build       |   5 ++
 src/ipa/simple/data/s5k3l6xx.yaml     |  98 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgw1p.yaml      | 102 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 510 insertions(+)
