+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
+#
+# libcamera 0.7.2 soft-ISP tuning for the GalaxyCore GC5035 on the Galaxy A52 5G.
+# NOTE: libcamera picks this file by sensor model, so the DEPTH (22-0037) and
+# the MACRO (22-003f) camera both load it.
+#
+# Sources (stock A525FXXUAFXL2 CamX, decoded in cameras/depth/REPORT.md):
+# - blackLevel: 64 @ 10 bit. Stock depth Chromatix bls12 = 1040/16384
+#   (65 @ 10 bit, 1070..1280 only in low light), macro bls12 = 1024 (64);
+#   measured on the depth module: dark frame mean 64.2..64.5 at 1x.
+# - Ccm: the depth tuning (tuned.lsi_gc5035.bin, cc13) is an IDENTITY matrix,
+#   Samsung never shows depth frames. These are the macro tuning's cc13
+#   matrices for the indoor lux range (tuned.lsi_gc5035_macro.bin, lux index
+#   280..340): same sensor die, so the best stock colour data there is for
+#   the depth module. Remove the Ccm block for the stock depth behaviour.
